OL,3,GNEWSACharity buys waterside pub from
OL,4,AGreene King
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity has bought the freehold of a
OL,7,Fpub at Willen Lake in Milton Keynes.
OL,9,FThe Lakeside Pub was previously owned
OL,10,Fby Greene King, which announced in
OL,11,FMarch that it planned to sell 150
OL,12,Fvenues.
OL,14,FThe Parks Trust, which manages Willen
OL,15,FLake and other parks across Milton
OL,16,FKeynes, acquired the site and said it
OL,17,Fwould reveal its plans for it "in due
OL,18,Fcourse".
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
