OL,3,GNEWSACharity buys waterside pub from
OL,4,AGreene King
OL,5,
OL,6,FRob Wood, executive director of Willen
OL,7,FLake, said: "We are still in the very
OL,8,Fearly stages of exploring future
OL,9,Fpossibilities and would ask the public
OL,10,Fto bear with us while the building
OL,11,Fremains closed for the time being."
